<p dir="auto">This PR primarily updates the "See also" of web browser glossary pages (Safari, Chrome, Firefox, Edge, Opera, and IE) to add cross-references between all browser entries.</p>
<p dir="auto">Inspired by the links in Safari's <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Glossary/Apple_Safari#see_also" rel="nofollow">See also</a> section, this PR adds similar links to "See also"s on Chrome and Firefox pages.</p>
